I've been playing on and off for a few years now.

I think a moron could have ascended this game, BUT I'LL TAKE IT!! :)

My pal Slinky and I and a pretty nice trip to Minetown.
Dipped for Excalibur at lvl 5.
Next level down found +2 GOP!
Got to Minetown at about lvl 10.

Izchak was extremely generous, providing me with not one, but two
magic lamps!
I decided not to wish until I I found out what sokoban had to offer.

Sokoban gave me reflection, so I wished for GDSM, and a magic marker.

Made the trip back to the mines, went to buy protection, and I guess I
lost count of my pets.
Dead priest had +3 cloak of magic resistance.

Spent some time iding, making holy water, enchanting armor and weapon.
(Excalibur and silver saber)

Got a bit nervous on the level below minetown. FINALLY get my pet to
follow me down and I see an arch-lich.
Silly gnome found a poly trap. Think he did it on purpose to scare me.

Got mines end, got luckstone, and went looking for the fort.

The fort killed off my pets. (better them then me)
Gained silver dragon scales. Decided to change up from AoR + GDSM to
SDSM +CoMR.
The forst also provided me with at least one wand of death.
Found another GOP! enchanted to +6.
Found speedboots just after the fort.

At this point I was quite excited. I have never had so many good items
so early in the game.

Went on to do the quest. Killed Lord Surtur pretty handily and what do
I find? A wand of wishing!

capped all armor and weapons at that point.
ided everything.
Polyed for rings.
genocided like crazy.

Then it was smooth sailing through medusa and the castle. More
wishing!!!

Had everything I could think of for an ascension attempt.

Went down and found the vibrating square.

spent some time clearing paths from stair to stair.

stashed wands of digging by level 1 (yes, I went up and down a few
times to make sure I wasn't missing anything)

Killed Rodney with wand of digging -> wand of death.

pick up the book, head down, do the ritual clear out the sanctum.

Seems I did leave something behind at this point, My wands of secret
door detection. Apparently I left them in my orcus town stash. Didn't
want to play around with Rodney so I got pretty warm while searching
for the door.

Grabbed the Amulet and had clear sailing to the plane of air.

Air elementals scare the hell out of me. Luckily I had the AoLS. Well,
I had 3 of them :)

A gremlin in the plane of water made finding the portal absolute hell.
In no time at all they were all low HP, but seeing the portal and not
being able to get to it a few times will drive a person batty.

On the Astral Plane, My altar was the second one I went to. Came close
to dieing near the first one, then remembered I still had a wand of
death in my BoH. Blasted a hole and came up on the second altar.

Looked.

Looked again.

Looked a third time.

Couldn't believe it I was actually going to ascend.

Looked a fourth time.

checked everything. (I wasn't gonna get this close after all this time
and find out I screwed something up)

Ascended :)



